#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 36
#: rc.cpp:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to setup the state of NumLock after KDE "
"startup.<p>You can configure NumLock to be turned on or off, or configure "
"KDE not to set NumLock state."
msgstr ""
"Indien ondersteun, hierdie opsie laat jou toe om in te stel die status van "
"NommerSluit na KDE selflaai.<p>Jy kan konfigureer NommerSluit om aan of af "
"gedraai te wees, of konfigureer KDE om nie in te stel NommerSluit status."

